{"bbox":[104.652,173.448,506.736,496.584],"caption":"Figure 6: Three years of the DAX backtest beginning in October 1987 and showing the EVT conditional quantile estimate $\\hat { x } _ { 0 . 9 9 } ^ { t }$ (dashed line) and the EVT unconditional quantile estimate æo.99 (dotted line) superimposed on the negative log returns. The conditional EVT estimate clearly responds quickly to the high volatility around the 1987 stock market crash.","figure_id":"2000-mcneil-frey-tail-risk-evt:p0026:figure:0001","page_number":26,"paper_id":"2000-mcneil-frey-tail-risk-evt","provenance":{"extractor_name":"MinerU pipeline","extractor_version":"3.4.4","model_hash":"ed6b654c018d742e65a17671e379c5e6ecc87ec9","source_pdf_sha256":"9ab9f1149fe5acb8e9e6502e245676a855c4c629e3207179d4c0090acc465e03"},"source_asset":"assets/figures/2000-mcneil-frey-tail-risk-evt-p0026-block-0001-00d6a66d91c609b9.jpg","source_bbox_normalized":[171,219,828,627],"source_block_id":"2000-mcneil-frey-tail-risk-evt:p0026:block:0001","verification_status":"unverified"}
{"bbox":[104.652,158.4,507.96,481.536],"caption":"Figure 7: Violations of $\\hat { x } _ { 0 . 9 9 } ^ { t }$ and $\\hat { x } _ { 0 . 9 9 }$ corresponding to the backtest in Figure 6. Triangles, circles and squares denote violations of the conditional normal, conditional EVT and unconditional EVT estimates respectively. The conditional normal estimate like the conditional EVT estimate responds to changing volatility but tends to be violated rather more often, because it does not take into account the leptokurtosis of the residuals. The unconditional EVT estimate cannot respond quickly to changing volatility and tends to be violated several times in a row in stress periods.","figure_id":"2000-mcneil-frey-tail-risk-evt:p0027:figure:0001","page_number":27,"paper_id":"2000-mcneil-frey-tail-risk-evt","provenance":{"extractor_name":"MinerU pipeline","extractor_version":"3.4.4","model_hash":"ed6b654c018d742e65a17671e379c5e6ecc87ec9","source_pdf_sha256":"9ab9f1149fe5acb8e9e6502e245676a855c4c629e3207179d4c0090acc465e03"},"source_asset":"assets/figures/2000-mcneil-frey-tail-risk-evt-p0027-block-0001-b87fb7b5d8f546b2.jpg","source_bbox_normalized":[171,200,830,608],"source_block_id":"2000-mcneil-frey-tail-risk-evt:p0027:block:0001","verification_status":"unverified"}
